/-!
# HPC: the classification of homogeneous plane continua

The library `HPC` is the import closure of `HPC.BJ59.BJ59E`, which holds the final theorems
`HPC.BJ59.ho16_classification₄` and `HPC.BJ59.ho16_classification_plane₄` (and imports
`HPC.BJ59.BJ59D`, which holds `HPC.BJ59.ho16_classification_atomic'`). Modules under `HPC/` outside
this closure are in the libraries `HPCExtra`, `HPCArchive` and `HPCCensus`. Build with `lake build`
(or `lake build HPC`).
-/
